msgid "游戏语言"
msgstr "Game Language"

msgid "简体中文"
msgstr "Simplified Chinese"

msgid "繁体中文"
msgstr "Traditional Chinese"

msgid "国际服请设置为繁体中文"
msgstr "Set this to Traditional Chinese for the international server."

msgid ""
"1. 自动战斗依赖按键识别，请在游戏设置中打开快捷键显示，提升出牌准确率。\n"
"2. 国际服玩家请将本模式配置中的\"游戏语言\"设置为繁体中文。"
msgstr ""
"1. Auto battle relies on shortcut recognition. Enable shortcut display in the game settings for better accuracy.\n"
"2. International server players should set Game Language to Traditional Chinese in this mode."

msgid ""
"1. 请主动打开游戏内自动战斗和自动剧情功能。\n"
"2. 国际服玩家请将本模式配置中的\"游戏语言\"设置为繁体中文。"
msgstr ""
"1. Enable auto battle and auto story in the game.\n"
"2. International server players should set Game Language to Traditional Chinese in this mode."

msgid "首层结束策略"
msgstr "First-floor completion strategy"

msgid "自动逃离"
msgstr "Automatically escape"

msgid "目标装备达标时暂停"
msgstr "Pause when target equipment count is reached"

msgid "暂停所需目标装备数量"
msgstr "Target equipment count required to pause"

msgid "仅在开启“只打第一层”时生效。默认自动逃离；选择“目标装备达标时暂停”后，首层结束时目标装备数量达标则暂停，否则自动逃离。装备达标暂停优先于首层闪光重刷。"
msgstr "Only applies when First Floor Only is enabled. Escape automatically by default. With the target equipment strategy, pause at the end of the first floor if the required count is reached; otherwise escape. Equipment-based pausing takes priority over restarting for a missing first-floor Flash."

msgid "取值1～3。统计刷存档主战员当前已装备且命中对应装备位优先级列表的装备，每个装备位计1件。"
msgstr "Range: 1-3. Count equipment currently worn by the save-data target character that matches the priority list for its slot. Each slot counts as one item."

msgid "装备选择策略"
msgstr "Equipment selection strategy"

msgid "原有策略"
msgstr "Original strategy"

msgid "仅目标主战员列表装备"
msgstr "Only listed equipment for the target character"

msgid "原有策略：优先给刷存档主战员升级，否则随机给队友。仅目标主战员列表装备：只安装对应装备位优先级列表内且符合原有替换规则的装备，不分配给队友；其余提炼，商店中则取消购买。"
msgstr "Original strategy: prioritize upgrades for the save-data target character, then randomly equip teammates. Target-only strategy: equip only items listed for their slot that satisfy the existing replacement rules. Refine other items, or cancel their purchase in shops, instead of equipping teammates."
